chapters\" entry marked ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:10:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690151","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4952500-1846651706684096","game_id":"steam-4952500","kind":"update","title":"Small Demo Update: Monitor Selection and Camera Drag","summary":"Hi everyone, This is a small update. Here's what's new: New and Improved A new Monitor option in Settings → Quality → Display lets you choose which screen the game runs on. You can now drag to rotate the camera. The How to Play guide in Help now notes: Your points, level and focus history from the demo will carry over to the full game, which will add many more items and outfits to unlock. More natural gaze for Yiling: her eyes no longer wander when picking up or putting down items, her gaze duri","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T08:37:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684096","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4952500-1846651706676545","game_id":"steam-4952500","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Particle FX Are Here","summary":"Hi everyone, Thank you for playing the demo! This update opens up particle FX, so you can shape the effects in Yiling's room yourself. Here's what's new: Particle FXA new Room tab in Dress Up, with two FX items: the Hologram Box on the desk, and the Holo Window. Tune the particles in the item details: particle count, color, position and more. Hit Generate Random for a new effect every time, or write your own Formula under Advanced to move the particles exactly the way you want. Save the effects ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T06:43:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676545","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4952500-1846018067933176","game_id":"steam-4952500","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Costumes Are Here, with the New Summer Gym Uniform","summary":"Hi everyone, Thanks for all your support on the demo! Today's update opens up costumes, and Yiling has her first new outfit. Here's what's new: Costumes Are HereThe Costume tab in Dress Up is now open, so you can change Yiling's top and socks. New outfit: the Summer Gym Uniform, plus three kinds of socks: Ankle Socks, Mid-Calf Socks and Thigh-High Socks. New items are unlocked with Points, which Yiling earns while she focuses. Other UpdatesRedesigned the \"Log progress\" pop-up for plans. Bug Fixe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T12:34:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933176","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4952500-1845383656396539","game_id":"steam-4952500","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Redesigned Plans Panel","summary":"Hi everyone, Thanks for all your support on the demo! Today's update redesigns the Plans panel. Here's what's new: Redesigned Plans Panel A brand-new layout: your plans are clearer to read, and every feature is more intuitive to use. New Notes: add optional details to any plan. Notes sync through Steam Cloud. Search by plan title, tag or note. Your existing plans, focus records and game progress are all kept. Ripple Lane 101: Moments With You will be taking part in Steam Next Fest starting Octob","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T14:03:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396539","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4952500-1845383656392548","game_id":"steam-4952500","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: How to Play Guide, Interface Settings & Redesigned Audio Bar","summary":"Hi everyone, Thanks for all your support and feedback on the demo! Today's update adds a How to Play guide and Interface settings, redesigns the audio bar, and tweaks a number of smaller details. Here's what's new: New How to Play: the first time you start the game, a short guide explains how the story advances and how outfits are unlocked. You can view it again anytime in Settings → Help. Interface settings page: use \"Background dimming\" to adjust how much the scene darkens behind an open panel","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T04:52:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656392548","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4952500-1845383656388836","game_id":"steam-4952500","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Graphics Settings Overhaul, Better Indoor Shadows & Floating Pomodoro Timer","summary":"Hi everyone, Thanks for all your support and feedback on the demo! Today's update overhauls the graphics settings, improves indoor shadows, adds a floating mini Pomodoro timer, and brings a round of tweaks to several panels. Here's what's new: Graphics & Performance Graphics settings overhaul: added three presets (Low, Standard and Ultra), with per-option adjustments available under \"Quality details\". Render scale can now be set anywhere from 50% to 200%. Improved indoor shadows on sunny days an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T10:47:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656388836","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4952500-1845383656379687","game_id":"steam-4952500","kind":"update","title":"Ripple Lane 101 : Moments With You — Demo Day-One Update","summary":"Thank you for your interest! Alongside the demo launch, we're rolling out a sizeable update: Settings New \"Render scale\" option, with a default picked automatically for your screen resolution — noticeably higher frame rates on high-resolution displays Higher maximum volume: full volume is now louder than before, while the default volume stays the same New \"Auto camera\" toggle All-new Inspiration panel A redesigned interface for recording your inspirations; you can now create and delete your own ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T03:58:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656379687","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:32:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4952500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:56Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:55Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4952500":"2026-10-26T05:33:56Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4952500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:55Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:55Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5112770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:56Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:56Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4952500","app_id":4952500,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:10Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"sto